This PR:
- removes only that obsolete execution block from `scripts/test-current-semantic-slice.sh`;
- preserves `tests/fixtures/bare-sid-literal-v1.lisp` unchanged;
- keeps legacy SID coverage in migration/compatibility lanes;
- does not change parser behavior or semantic authority.

No baseline relaxation and no new semantic exemption.

